   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "## Venice AI · Text → image → video\n\nThe image from **Venice AI · Image** is the start image of **Venice AI · Video**. Both prompts are saved as `.txt`.\n\n* Keep **seed** fixed while you tune the video prompt: ComfyUI then reuses the cached image and only the video is generated (and billed) again.\n* Try **preview** first, then switch it off for the full run.\n* Short side of the start image ≥ 300 px for Seedance (checked before sending).\n\n[MODELS.md](https://github.com/Slartibart23/ComfyUI-Venice-AI-Nodes/blob/main/docs/MODELS.md)\n\n🇩🇪 Bild erzeugen und direkt als Startbild für das Video nutzen. **seed** fest lassen, dann wird nur das Video neu berechnet.\n\n**API key:** put your Venice key into `Venice_AI_API.txt` in the ComfyUI folder (one line). Every run is billed to your Venice account.\n\n🇩🇪 Key in `Venice_AI_API.txt` im ComfyUI-Ordner. Jeder Lauf kostet Venice-Guthaben."
   ],
   "widgets_values_named": {
    "text": "## Venice AI · Text → image → video\n\nThe image from **Venice AI · Image** is the start image of **Venice AI · Video**. Both prompts are saved as `.txt`.\n\n* Keep **seed** fixed while you tune the video prompt: ComfyUI then reuses the cached image and only the video is generated (and billed) again.\n* Try **preview** first, then switch it off for the full run.\n* Short side of the start image ≥ 300 px for Seedance (checked before sending).\n\n[MODELS.md](https://github.com/Slartibart23/ComfyUI-Venice-AI-Nodes/blob/main/docs/MODELS.md)\n\n🇩🇪 Bild erzeugen und direkt als Startbild für das Video nutzen. **seed** fest lassen, dann wird nur das Video neu berechnet.\n\n**API key:** put your Venice key into `Venice_AI_API.txt` in the ComfyUI folder (one line). Every run is billed to your Venice account.\n\n🇩🇪 Key in `Venice_AI_API.txt` im ComfyUI-Ordner. Jeder Lauf kostet Venice-Guthaben."
   },
   "color": "#432",
   "bgcolor": "#653"
  }
